Ladybird displays up to 20 rows of a long select popup in one scrollable
column. Its short popup uses the regular menu.

Blink sets a 20-row limit in ListPicker, then fits the popup to the
available screen. Gecko constrains the menu to its browser in
SelectParent.sys.mjs. WebKit uses the platform menu in
WebPopupMenuProxyMac::showPopupMenu().

A 250-option probe ran on Chrome 158.0.8127.37, Firefox 151.0, and
WebKit 26.5. None exposed the native popup in a page screenshot, so the
comparisons of popup height come from source inspection.
